| 1;1  2015-01-12
| 1;2  2015-12-06/jes: clean up cases where space is added next to a [ts]
|      or [te] (including the "embedded" variants thereof with idle codes)
|      and there was a space on the other side already
 |028ts|031|028big|031 ~ |028ts|031~
 |028ts|031|028idle|~ete|031|028big|031 ~ |028ts|031|028idle|~ete|031~
|028big|031 |028te|031 ~|028te|031 ~
|028big|031 |028idle|~ets|031|028te|031 ~|028idle|~ets|031|028te|031 ~
|028l|031|028big|031 ~|028l|031~
|028<|031|028big|031 ~|028<|031~
|028big|031 |028l|031~|028l|031~
|028big|031 |028<|031~|028<|031~
